<title>USA: Capitol Transamerica declares stock split.</title>
<headline>Capitol Transamerica declares stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Wis. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Transamerica Corp said its board of directors Thursday declared a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The company said there will be 11.4 million common shares outstanding after the split, which follows the announcement of a 54.1-percent increase in earnings in the first nine months of fiscal 1996 to $2.94 per share, up from $1.33 in 1995.</p>
